## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **`notify` crate** | Cross-platform (inotify/FSEvents/ReadDirectoryChanges) without raw syscalls |
| **`RecursiveMode::Recursive`** | Catches changes in all subdirectories |
| **Append-only log file** | Audit logs should never overwrite previous entries |
| **Timestamps via `chrono`** | Millisecond-precision local time for forensic usefulness |
| **Filter out `Other`/`Any`** | Reduces noise — only log meaningful actions |
| **Sync `mpsc` channel** | Simple blocking loop; no async runtime needed for a basic watcher |

```rust
use std::collections::VecDeque;
use std::fmt;
