## Key Design Decisions

| Choice | Reason |
|---|---|
| **JSON Lines (`.jsonl`)** | One JSON object per line — append-friendly, easy to grep, stream-parseable |
| **UUID v4 IDs** | Globally unique without coordination |
| **UTC timestamps** | Avoids timezone ambiguity in logs |
| **Substring filtering** | Practical for quick CLI lookups without regex overhead |
| **No database** | Flat file keeps it portable and zero-dependency at runtime |

