## Key Concepts

| Approach | Class Used | Best For |
|---|---|---|
| **Strongly-typed** | `JsonSerializer` | Known, fixed JSON schema |
| **DOM exploration** | `JsonDocument` | Inspecting unknown structures |
| **Dynamic dictionary** | `Dictionary<string, JsonElement>` | Semi-structured data |
| **File parsing** | `File.ReadAllText` + `JsonSerializer` | Disk-based documents |

> **No external packages needed** — `System.Text.Json` is built into .NET 6+. For older projects or advanced features, `Newtonsoft.Json` (`JsonConvert.DeserializeObject<T>`) is an alternative.

