## Key Design Points

| Concept | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Input format** | JSON lines (JSONL) — one JSON object per line |
| **Validation** | Required `level` + `message`, optional `timestamp`, `service`, `meta` |
| **Enrichment** | Auto-generates `id`, normalizes `level`, adds `_ingested_at` |
| **Storage** | File-based (append-only JSONL) + in-memory option |
| **Ingestion modes** | HTTP server (`POST /logs`) and stdin pipe (`file-ingester.js`) |
| **No dependencies** | Uses only Node.js built-in modules |

