## Bug Summary Table

| # | Bug | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|-----|-----------|-----|
| 1 | Crash on missing `config` | No default parameter | `config = {}` + merged defaults |
| 2 | Crash on `null` message | No input validation | Guard clause at `lint()` entry |
| 3 | Nested arrays in `violations` | `push()` of sub-arrays | `.flat().filter(Boolean)` |
| 4 | `passed` always `false` | Loose equality + stale items | `===` + correct flat list |
| 5 | Case bypass | Case-sensitive compare | `.toLowerCase()` + `gi` flag |
| 6 | Partial word match | `String.includes()` | `\b` word-boundary regex |
| 7 | Inconsistent return type | `undefined` on pass | Always return `[]` |
| 8 | Skewed caps %

