## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| **Unreliable `fs.watch`** | `chokidar` handles cross-platform quirks, symlinks, and atomic writes |
| **Rapid saves (Ctrl+S spam)** | Per-file debounce timer — only the last event within 300ms fires |
