📝 Processing job a3f1... | Type: sales
✅ Job a3f1... completed. { file: 'sales_2024-01-01_2024-06-30.csv', rows: 1240 }
📝 Processing job b7d2... | Type: inventory
✅ Job b7d2... completed. { file: 'inventory_east.csv', rows: 530 }
📝 Processing job c9e4... | Type: users
✅ Job c9e4... completed. { file: 'users_admin.csv', rows: 87 }
