## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | Choice | Reason |
|---|---|---|
| **Arg parsing** | `clap` derive | Type-safe, auto-generates `--help` |
| **Formats** | text / csv / json | Covers human-readable + machine-parseable |
| **Output** | stdout or file | Pipe-friendly, composable with other tools |
| **Data source** | In-memory sample data | Swap `load_sales_data()` for a real DB/CSV reader |
| **Filtering** | category, min amount, limit | Demonstrates extensible pattern |

The tool is structured so you can replace the hardcoded sample data in `data.rs` with actual file or database reads without touching the formatting or CLI layers.

