## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| **Zero dependencies** | Only uses Node built-ins (`fs`, `path`) |
| **ES modules** | Modern `import/export` syntax |
| **Separate formatters** | Adding a new format = one new file + one line in the router |
| **Loader handles CSV + JSON** | Most common simple data formats |
| **Summary auto-detects numeric cols** | No config needed — numbers get `sum/avg/min/max` automatically |
| **Groups are optional** | Flat table by default, `--group` adds breakdowns |

