## How it works

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                      Application Code                        │
│                                                              │
│  client.counter(…)   client.gauge(…)   client.histogram(…)  │
│        │                   │                   │             │
│        └───────────┬───────┘───────────────────┘             │
│                    ▼                                         │
│            mpsc::channel (bounded, 10k)                      │
│                    │                                         │
├────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    ▼                                         │
│         ┌─────────────────────┐                              │
│         │  AggregationWorker  │   (background tokio task)    │
│         │                     │                              │
│         │  tokio::select! {   │                              │
│         │    sample ──► bucket│                              │
│         │    tick   ──► flush │──► emit / store snapshot     │
│         │    notify ──► drain │──► final flush + exit        │
│         │  }                  │                              │
│         └─────────────────────┘                              │
│                    │                                         │
│                    ▼                                         │
│   Arc<RwLock<Option<MetricsSnapshot>>>  (readable by main)   │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Key design decisions

| Aspect | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Channel** | Bounded `mpsc` — backpressure if producers overwhelm the worker |
| **Aggregation** | In-memory `HashMap` buckets reset every flush interval |
| **Thread safety** | `MetricsClient` is `Clone + Send` — share freely across tasks |
| **Shutdown** | `Notify` signal → drain remaining channel

