## Summary of All 15 Bugs Fixed

```
┌─────┬──────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Bug │ Problem                      │ Fix                                │
├─────┼──────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────┤
│  1  │ processedMessages = {} grows │ Map + pruneProcessedCache()        │
│     │ forever (memory leak)        │                                    │
│  2  │ setInterval(function(){})    │ Arrow function () => {}            │
│     │ loses `this` context         │                                    │
│  3  │ Timer not cleared on stop()  │ clearInterval(this.timer)          │
│  4  │ No message validation        │ Check id, content, userId + dedup  │
│  5  │ Loose == comparison          │ Strict === comparison              │
│  6  │ Processes entire queue       │ .slice(0, this.batchSize)          │
│  7  │ No await in loop / fire-all  │ for..of with await + try/catch     │
│  8  │ No error handling on API     │ try/catch in moderateMessage()     │
│  9  │ Completed items stay queued  │ cleanupQueue() removes them        │
│ 10  │ Missing Content-Type header  │ Added headers to fetch()           │
│ 11  │ No request timeout           │ AbortController + setTimeout       │
│ 12  │ Wrong timestamp on alert     │ Date.now() for alert time          │
│ 13  │ Only first moderator notified│ Route by severity level            │
│ 14  │ No max-retry guard           │ Check retries < maxRetries         │
│ 15  │ Stats count all as pending   │ reduce() counts by actual status   │
└─────┴──────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────┘
```

