## All Bugs Annotated

| # | Bug | Impact |
|---|-----|--------|
| 1 | `sensitiveScopes` declared at module scope — shared across files | False positives/negatives when linting batches |
| 2 | Single `auditLogFound` boolean for all scopes | One audit call "satisfies" every scope |
| 3 | Case-sensitive `includes()` | Misses `deleteUser`, `CreateOrder` |
| 4 | Only inspects `ObjectExpression` arguments | Misses `auditLog(buildPayload())` or spreads |
| 5 | Reads `prop.key.name` without null check | Crash on computed `[VAR]` or `Literal` keys |
| 6 | Only matches bare `auditLog(…)` identifier | Misses `logger.audit()`, `this.auditLog()`, `await` |
| 7 | Only checks immediate parent for `CatchClause` | Misses nested try-catch structures |
| 8 | `==` instead of `===` | Unreliable comparison |
| 9 | Missing `ArrowFunctionExpression` selector | Arrow function handlers are ignored |
| 10 | No scope-level tracking of which audit call belongs where | Reports against wrong function |
| 11 | `fields` array can contain `undefined` entries | `includes()` gives wrong results |
| 12 | Reports at `Program:exit` instead of function exit | Cannot correlate per-function |
| 13 | Never resets state | Stale data carries between files |

