## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Reasoning |
|---|---|
| **BullMQ + Redis** | Persistent, supports retries/priorities/rate-limiting out of the box |
| **Exponential backoff** | DB or API might be temporarily down — don't hammer it |
| **Rate limiter on worker** | 10 jobs/min prevents overwhelming your database |
| **Generator registry** | Adding a new report = one file + one registry entry |
| **Lazy import for heavy libs** | `exceljs` only loads when xlsx is requested |
| **Pre-signed URLs** | Files never flow through your API server on download |
| **Graceful shutdown** | Active reports finish before the process exits |

