## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Throughput** | Batched inserts (50 records or every 3s) — single `INSERT ... VALUES` instead of per-message |
| **At-least-once** | Messages acked only after successful DB write; `ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING` handles duplicates |
| **Backpressure** | `prefetch(20)` limits in-flight messages so the consumer doesn't get overwhelmed |
| **Failures** | Retry up to 3× via requeue, then route to DLQ for manual inspection |
| **Reconnection** | Auto-reconnects on connection drop with a delay |
| **Shutdown** | SIGINT/SIGTERM triggers: stop consuming → flush buffer → close DB → exit |
| **Querying** | Indexes on `actor_id`, `action`, `resource`, and `created_at` cover the most common audit lookups |

