## Bug Summary Table

| # | Bug | Impact | Fix |
|---|-----|--------|-----|
| 1 | No task tracking | Can't monitor or limit runs | `ReportScheduler` class with state |
| 2 | Invalid cron `'60 * * * *'` | Task **never fires** | Changed to `'0 * * * *'` |
| 3 | Not awaiting async fn | Errors silently swallowed | `await` + `#safeExecute` wrapper |
| 4 | No timezone config | Reports run at wrong time | `{ timezone }` option in `cron.schedule` |
| 5 | No try/catch on DB calls | Unhandled crash | `try/finally` blocks |
| 6 | `client.release()` missing | **Connection pool exhaustion** | `finally { client.release() }` |
| 7 | `writeFileSync` blocks loop | All requests stall during I/O | `fs.promises.writeFile` |
| 8 | Unbounded `reports[]` array | **Memory leak** over time | Bounded history with `slice()` |
| 9 | No concurrency guard | Duplicate/corrupt reports | Lock flag per task type |
| 10 | No query timeout | Hangs indefinitely | `statement_timeout` in pool config |
| 11 | No null

