## All Identified Bugs

```
Bug #  | Location              | Description
-------|-----------------------|--------------------------------------------
1      | LintReport            | Shared mutable state (minor, architectural)
2      | totalIssues getter    | Only counts errors, ignores warnings
3      | addRule()             | Allows duplicate rule names
4      | lintFile()            | Sync I/O blocks event loop
5      | lintFile() catch      | Swallows file-read errors silently
6      | line loop             | Line numbers are 0-based (should be 1-based)
7      | rule loop             | Doesn't check rule.enabled flag
8      | rule catch block      | Silently swallows rule execution errors
9      | lintDirectory()       | No file extension filtering
10     | lintDirectory()       | Recurses into node_modules / hidden dirs
11     | generateReport()      | Issues not sorted by file → line
12     | generateReport()      | Missing 'html' or unknown format handling
13     | text format loop      | Typo: `allIssue` instead of `allIssues`
14     | noConsoleRule          | Returns string instead of { message }
15     | maxLineLengthRule      | Doesn't skip comment lines
16     | maxLineLengthRule      | Missing `return null` for non-match
17     | noVarRule              | Matches 'var' inside words like 'variable'
```

