## Key design decisions

- **`fs.watch`** over `fs.watchFile` — event-driven, no polling, lower CPU
- **Debouncing** — suppresses duplicate OS-level events (common on macOS/Linux)
- **Known-file set** — distinguishes creates from renames from deletes (since `fs.watch` only reports `rename` for all three)
- **Append-only log** — `appendFileSync` ensures entries survive crashes
- **No dependencies** — uses only Node.js built-ins

