## Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Dependencies** | Zero (stdlib only) | Keep it simple and portable |
| **Storage** | Flat JSON files | No DB setup needed, human-readable |
| **Strike system** | 1 → warn, 2 → mute, 3+ → ban | Configurable via `config.json` |
| **Word matching** | Case-insensitive `includes()` | Catches substrings too |
| **Module style** | ES Modules (`import`) | Modern Node.js convention |

