## 📊 Bug Summary

| #  | Bug | Root Cause | Fix |
|----|-----|-----------|-----|
| 1  | Wrong execution order | `a - b` sorts ascending | Changed to `b - a` (descending) |
| 2  | Async callbacks not awaited | Missing `await` | Added `await task.callback()` |
| 3  | Delayed tasks fire out of order | `setTimeout` is non-blocking | Wrapped in `Promise` + `await` |
| 4  | `run()` doesn't await tasks | Missing `await` on `executeTask` | Added `await` in run loop |
| 5  | Timer memory leak | Timer IDs never stored/cleared | Used `Map` to track & clear timers |
| 6  | Skips elements during removal | `splice` shifts indices | Replaced with `Array.filter()` |
| 7  | `stop()` doesn't clear timers | Only sets flag | Iterates `timers` Map + `clearTimeout` |
| 8  | External mutation risk | Returns direct reference | Returns shallow copy via `map` |

