## Key Design Decisions

| Problem | Solution |
|---|---|
| `fs.watch` fires duplicate events | Debounce per-file with 300ms window |
| Large files trigger events mid-write | `waitForStableFile` checks size twice |
| Reprocessing same file on restart | Move completed files to `processed/` |
| Watcher crashes on bad input | Try/catch per file — watcher keeps running |
| Files present before watcher starts | `processExistingFiles()` on boot |

To add a new format (Excel, XML, etc.), drop a processor into `reporters/` and add one line to the `PROCESSORS` map.

