## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **BullMQ over raw Redis** | Built-in retries, backoff, concurrency control, job lifecycle |
| **Checks run sequentially** | A `reject` from profanity skips nothing — we collect *all* violations for the audit log |
| **Severity escalation** | Multiple flags don't downgrade a rejection; worst verdict wins |
| **Sliding window rate limit** | Sorted set in Redis — accurate, no fixed bucket edge cases |
| **Separate downstream queues** | Notifications and audit are decoupled — each scales independently |
| **`removeOnComplete` / `removeOnFail`** | Prevents Redis from growing unbounded in production |

