## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Solution |
|---|---|
| **Duplicate events** | 300ms debounce per file |
| **Event type detection** | Snapshot comparison (`knownFiles` map) since `fs.watch` doesn't distinguish create vs change reliably |
| **Pattern matching** | Simple extension check (`*` = all) — swap for `minimatch` if you need real globs |
| **Error isolation** | Each task runs in its own `try/catch` so one failure doesn't block others |
| **Cleanup** | `SIGINT` handler calls `stop()` to close the watcher cleanly |

