## Bug Summary Table

| # | Location | Bug | Fix |
|---|----------|-----|-----|
| 1 | `meta` | Missing `fixable` & `schema` | Add both properties |
| 2 | `nestedScheduleDepth` | Never decremented in `:exit` | Add decrement in exit visitor |
| 3 | `isSchedulerCall()` | Ignores `window.setTimeout` | Handle `MemberExpression` callee |
| 4 | `getDelayArg()` | Reads `arguments[0]` (the callback) as delay | Use `arguments[1]` |
| 5 | `hasErrorHandling()` | Skips `FunctionExpression` nodes | Accept both function types |
| 6 | `hasErrorHandling()` | Wrong AST node type string | Use `"TryStatement"` |
| 7 | `isReturnedOrAssigned()` | Misses `ReturnStatement` & `AwaitExpression` | Add extra parent checks |
| 8 | `report()` data | Keys don't match `{{delay}}`/`{{max}}` | Rename to `delay` and `max` |

