## Key Takeaways

```
Bug Fix                              Why It Matters
─────────────────────────────────    ──────────────────────────────────────
meta.schema added                    Lets ESLint validate rule options
MemberExpression callee check        Catches window.setTimeout / globalThis.*
arguments[1] for delay               Prevents reading the callback as a delay
Accept FunctionExpression too        Many codebases use `function(){}` callbacks
"TryStatement" (correct AST type)    "TryCatchStatement" doesn't exist in ESTree
Unwrap AwaitExpression in parent     Handles `const id = await schedule(…)`
Match data keys to {{placeholders}}  Otherwise report() prints "undefined"
Decrement depth on :exit             Prevents false positives after first match
