## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **JSON flat file** | Zero dependencies, human-readable, easy backup |
| **UUID per entry** | Every audit record is uniquely identifiable |
| **ISO 8601 timestamps** | Sortable, timezone-unambiguous |
| **No external deps** | Uses only `node:fs`, `node:path`, `node:crypto`, `node:os` |
| **Severity levels** | 4 tiers (`info/warn/error/critical`) cover most use cases |
| **`--json` flag on list** | Lets you pipe output into `jq` or other tools |

