## Key Design Decisions

| Concept | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Exponential backoff** | `baseDelay × factor^attempt` + random jitter |
| **Per-stage retry config** | Each stage gets its own `withRetry` wrapper |
| **Retryable vs fatal errors** | `shouldRetry` predicate filters transient errors only |
| **Pipeline short-circuit** | Failure after all retries stops remaining stages |
| **Observability** | Structured JSON logs + per-stage duration metrics |
| **Invalid data handling** | Bad records are tracked alongside valid ones (no silent drops) |

