## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Input** | File, string, or stdin — all parse to JS objects |
| **Stages** | Pure functions chained via `.addStage()` |
| **Immutability** | Stages return new data, never mutate input |
| **Error handling** | Each stage is try/caught with clear messages |
| **Observability** | Timing + record counts logged per stage |
| **Composability** | Stage functions are curried for reuse |

