## Key Design Decisions

```
┌──────────────┐     ┌─────────┐     ┌──────────────┐
│  Express API │────▶│  Redis  │◀────│  Worker(s)   │
│  (producer)  │     │ (queue) │     │  (consumer)  │
└──────────────┘     └─────────┘     └──────┬───────┘
                                            │
                                     ┌──────┴───────┐
                                     │  PostgreSQL   │ ← data source
                                     │  S3           │ ← file output
                                     └──────────────┘
```

| Concern | How it's handled |
|---|---|
| **Retries** | 3 attempts, exponential backoff (5s → 10s → 20s) |
| **Concurrency** | Configurable per worker, rate-limited to protect DB |
| **Progress** | `job.updateProgress(pct)` — clients can poll |

