## How It Works

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     FileSync Flow                            │
│                                                              │
│  ./source/              ./backup/                            │
│  ├── notes.txt    ──►   ├── notes.txt     (copy if changed) │
│  ├── data/        ──►   ├── data/                            │
│  │   └── db.json  ──►   │   └── db.json   (skip if same)    │
│  └── img.png      ──►   └── img.png                          │
│                                                              │
│  Orphan in backup only?  ──► 🗑️ Deleted                      │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                     Retry Flow                               │
│                                                              │
│  Attempt 1 ──► FAIL ──► wait  1s (1000 × 2⁰)               │
│  Attempt 2 ──► FAIL ──► wait  2s (1000 × 2¹)               │
│  Attempt 3 ──► FAIL ──► ❌ throw error                       │
│                                                              │
│  Attempt N ──► OK   ──► ✅ continue                          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Exponential Backoff** | Delay doubles each retry (`1s → 2s → 4s`) |
| **Smart Comparison** | Checks size → mtime → MD5 hash (fast to thorough) |
| **Orphan Cleanup** | Removes target files no longer in source |
| **Stream Copying** | Uses `ReadStream.pipe(WriteStream)` for memory efficiency |
| **Timestamp Preservation** | Copies `atime`/`mtime` from source to target |
| **Continuous Mode** | Optional polling interval for ongoing sync |
| **Stats Tracking** | Reports copied / skipped / deleted / error counts |

