## Key Concepts

| Feature | Purpose |
|---|---|
| **FIFO Queue** | Messages processed in order received |
| **Async processing** | Non-blocking moderation checks |
| **Sequential drain** | `processNext()` calls itself after each message |
| **Banned words** | Simple keyword filter |
| **Caps detection** | Flags shouting/all-caps messages |
| **Char spam** | Catches repeated characters (`oooooo`) |
| **Stats tracking** | Counts approved/rejected totals |

This handles one message at a time to maintain order. For production, you'd swap the in-memory array for **Redis** or **RabbitMQ** and add rate limiting per user.

