## Bug Summary Table

| # | Bug | Fix |
|---|-----|-----|
| 1 | Missing `express.json()` middleware | Added `app.use(express.json())` |
| 2 | `authMiddleware` never calls `next()` | Added `next()` on valid key |
| 3 | Rate limiter: wrong unit comparison & never resets | Compare ms↔ms; reset count + startTime |
| 4 | No input validation on `/moderate` | Added `validateModerationInput()` |
| 5 | Mute check: ISO string vs timestamp comparison | Use numeric `Date.now() < muteEnd` + cleanup |
| 6 | Word filter: exact match only, case-sensitive | Regex with `\b` word boundaries, case-insensitive |
| 7 | No `break` after first banned-word match | Added `break` |
| 8 | `Math.random()` for IDs (collisions, non-unique) | Use `crypto.randomUUID()` |
| 9 | Blocked messages return `200 OK` | Return `202 Accepted` for blocked |
| 10 | Mute duration stored raw (not calculated) | Calculate `Date.now() + duration * 60000` |
| 11 | `/mute` route sends no response (client hangs) | Added `res.json(...)` |
| 12 | Query param `"false"` is truthy in JS | Parse explicitly: `flagged === 'true'` |
| 13 | `limit` is a string → `slice` misbehaves | `parseInt(limit, 10)` |
| 14 | String param `===` number in array | UUIDs are consistent string types |
| 15 | "Not found" returns `200` | Return `404` |
| 16 | `delete arr[i]` leaves `undefined` hole | Use `splice(index, 1)` |
| 17 | No global error handler | Added Express error middleware |
| 18 | Hardcoded port, no startup confirmation | `process.env.PORT` fallback + callback |

