## How It Works

| Concept | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Storage** | Simple `tasks.json` file — human-readable, no database needed |
| **IDs** | Auto-incrementing integer based on last entry |
| **Scheduling** | Stores ISO timestamps, compares against `new Date()` |
| **Watch mode** | `setInterval` polling loop that fires alerts for due tasks |
| **Interactive** | `readline` REPL loop for guided input |
| **Filtering** | `all`, `pending`, `done`, `overdue` via array `.filter()` |

Zero dependencies — only Node.js built-in modules (`fs`, `path`, `readline`).

