## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Filters** | Each check is an isolated method returning `{ passed, reason }` — easy to add new ones |
| **Persistence** | Banned words saved to JSON so edits survive restarts |
| **Severity** | Calculated from failure count + type (banned words always = high) |
| **Batch mode** | Swaps the readline listener temporarily, then restores the main prompt |
| **No dependencies** | Uses only Node.js built-ins (`readline`, `fs`, `path`) |

To add a new filter, just add a method in `Filters` and include it in the `analyzeMessage` checks array.

