## Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **JSONL format** | One JSON object per line — trivial to parse, grep, and stream |
| **SHA-256 hashing** | Detects content changes even when size stays the same |
| **Serialized writes** | Queue prevents corrupted lines from concurrent events |
| **`awaitWriteFinish`** | Waits for writes to stabilize so you log the final state, not partial writes |
| **Log rotation by size** | Prevents single files from growing unbounded |
