# Rust Config Parser with Rate Limiting

This example demonstrates a TOML-based config parser with a **token bucket** rate limiter, supporting multiple named policies and per-endpoint rules.

## Project Structure

```
rate_limiter/
├── Cargo.toml
├── config.toml
└── src/
    └── main.rs
```

## `Cargo.toml`

```toml
[package]
name = "rate_limiter"
version = "0.1.0"
edition = "2021"

[dependencies]
serde = { version = "1", features = ["derive"] }
toml = "0.8"
thiserror = "1"
```

