## Summary of All 15 Bugs Fixed

| # | Bug | Fix |
|---|-----|-----|
| 1 | Wrong `h`/`d` multiplier | Correct ms values: `3600000`, `86400000` |
| 2 | No input validation | Validate `name`, `schedule`, `reportFn` |
| 3 | No concurrency control | `maxConcurrent` gate + job queue |
| 4 | Missing `await` on async fn | `async/await` + timeout wrapper |
| 5 | Timer refs not stored | `Map` to store `setInterval` IDs |
| 6 | Direct result mutation | Spread into new object with `_meta` |
| 7 | Missing `.catch()` | `try/catch` with retry logic |
| 8 | `nextRun` set before completion | Set `nextRun` after `await` succeeds |
| 9 | `stop()` doesn't clear timers | Iterate `timers` Map + `clearInterval` |
| 10 | Returns mutable job reference | `Object.freeze()` on a shallow copy |
| 11 | `==` instead of `===` | `Map.get()` uses strict matching |
| 12 | Unsafe concurrent removal | Remove timer → queue → job (in order) |
| 13 | Timer not cleared on remove | `clearInterval` before `delete` |
| 14 | Shared mutable `reportData` | Each report function has isolated scope |
| 15 | Race condition on shared state | No shared mutable state between jobs |

