## How It Works

```
┌──────────┐  retry  ┌───────────┐  retry  ┌──────┐
│ Extract  │───────→│ Transform │───────→│ Load │
│ (flaky)  │  ⟳×2   │ (flaky)   │  ⟳×1   │      │
└──────────┘        └───────────┘        └──────┘
     ↓                    ↓                  ↓
  3 attempts          2 attempts         1 attempt
```

