## Key Design Decisions

| Feature | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Exponential backoff** | Delay doubles each retry (`500ms → 1000ms → 2000ms`) |
| **Selective retry** | Only retries exceptions listed in `retryOn()` |
| **Typed stages** | Each stage has explicit `<Input, Output>` types for compile-time safety |
| **Stage results** | Track duration and attempt count per stage for observability |
| **Custom config per stage** | Override `RetryConfig` on any individual `runStage()` call |
| **Fail-fast** | Non-retryable exceptions immediately abort the pipeline |

