=== Raw Dictionary ===
  title: Swift Programming Guide
  author: Jane Doe
  ...

=== Error Handling ===
❌ Type mismatch: expected String — ...
```

## Key Concepts

| Feature | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Typed parsing** | `Codable` + `JSONDecoder` |
| **Untyped parsing** | `JSONSerialization` → `[String: Any]` |
| **Custom key mapping** | `CodingKeys` enum |
| **Error handling** | Pattern-matched `DecodingError` cases |
| **File loading** | `Data(contentsOf:)` with path check |
| **Nullable fields** | Optional properties (`Metadata?`) |

The `Codable` approach is **preferred** for type safety, while `JSONSerialization` is useful when the JSON structure is unknown or dynamic.

