## How It Works

| Layer | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| **AuditEntry** | Immutable record — holds fields, handles serialization to/from one TSV line |
| **AuditStore** | Append-only file I/O — writes, reads, queries, and exports |
| **AuditCLI** | Parses args, routes to the right handler, formats output |

The log file (`audit.log`) is **append-only** and **tab-delimited** — one entry per line — so it stays `grep`/`awk`-friendly outside the tool as well.

