## Key Design Points

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Concurrency** | `ConcurrentHashMap` — watcher thread writes while main thread reads |
| **Updates** | `indexFile()` calls `removeFile()` first, so modified files re-index cleanly |
| **Subdirectories** | Recursively registered; new subdirs auto-registered on `CREATE` |
| **Search** | AND-based — all query terms must appear in a file to match |
| **Tokenization** | Simple alphanumeric split, lowercased, minimum 2 chars |

