## Key Design Points

| Aspect | Choice | Why |
|---|---|---|
| **Storage** | JSON flat file | Zero dependencies, human-readable, easy to back up |
| **Interface** | `IAuditStore` | Swap to SQLite/database later without touching commands |
| **Thread safety** | `lock` around file I/O | Safe for single-process concurrent calls |
| **Immutability** | `init`-only properties on `AuditEntry` | Audit records should never be mutated after creation |
| **Severity enum** | Stored as string in JSON | Readable logs, easy filtering |

