## Bug-Fix Summary

| # | Bug | Fix |
|---|-----|-----|
| **1** | JSON property casing mismatch (`id` vs `Id`) | `PropertyNameCaseInsensitive = true` in `JsonSerializerOptions` |
| **2** | `new HttpClient()` per call → socket exhaustion | Inject a **single** `HttpClient` (or use `IHttpClientFactory`) |
| **3** | No null/empty check on `message.Content` | Guard clause returns "allow" for empty content |
| **4** | Missing `Content-Type: application/json` | `new StringContent(json, Encoding.UTF8, "application/json")` |
| **5** | Double-slash if `_baseUrl` ends with `/` | `TrimEnd('/')` in constructor |
| **6** | API key never sent | `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header added |
| **7** | `.Result` causes **deadlocks** on UI/ASP.NET sync contexts | Replaced with `await … .ConfigureAwait(false)` |
| **8** | No HTTP status-code check | `response.IsSuccessStatusCode` check + throw |
| **9** | Case-sensitive JSON deserializer → null fields | Shared `JsonSerializerOptions` with case-insensitive flag |
| **10** | No null check after `Deserialize` | Explicit null guard + meaningful exception |
| **11** | `categories` could be `null` → `NullReferenceException` | Default `= new()` on model + `?? new List<string>()` |
| **12** | `DetermineAction` calls `.Contains` on null list | Null-coalescing + `StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase` |
| **13** | Fire-and-forget `PostAsync` — swallowed exceptions | Made `async Task`, added try/catch with logging |
| **14** | `DateTime.Now` in logs (ambiguous timezone) | Changed to `DateTime.UtcNow` |
| **15** | No rate-limiting for external API calls | `SemaphoreSlim` throttle wrapping each request |
| **16** | Sequential `await` in loop (O(n) latency) | `Task.WhenAll` for concurrent execution |

