## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Parsing** | Hand-rolled RFC 4180 parser — no external deps, handles quoted fields with embedded commas and escaped quotes |
| **Mapping DSL** | Infix functions (`map … to … transform … validate`) keep configuration readable |
| **Batching** | `chunked(batchSize)` controls memory and lets you do bulk DB inserts |
| **Error handling** | Errors are collected per-row rather than aborting, so one bad row doesn't stop the migration |
| **Sink abstraction** | The `(List<Map<String, String>>) -> Unit` lambda decouples the engine from any specific storage target |
| **Streaming** | `BufferedReader` + sequence avoids loading the entire file into memory |

