## Key Fix Summary

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Thread Safety     → serial DispatchQueue guards state   │
│  Retain Cycle      → DispatchSourceTimer + [weak self]   │
│  Array Mutation     → collect indices, remove in reverse  │
│  Force Unwrap      → guard with optional binding          │
│  Timer Cleanup      → cancel() in stop() AND deinit       │
│  Unbounded Growth  → cap completedTaskIDs history         │
│  Sort Order        → priority DESC, then executeAt ASC    │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
