## Key Design Points

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Concurrency** | `sync.RWMutex` protects the index; watcher runs in its own goroutine |
| **Debouncing** | 200ms `time.AfterFunc` prevents re-indexing on rapid saves |
| **Subdirectories** | `filepath.Walk` on startup + watching `Create` events for new dirs |
| **Update vs Create** | `AddFile` always removes old entries first, so it handles both |
| **Search** | AND-based — all query terms must appear in a file to match |

